profilePrivacy|Nimet ja tunnisteet tallentuvat tähän WITT-tiedostoon: niitä käytetään tekijyydessä, kommenteissa, arvioissa ja äänissä. Tämä on paikallinen käyttäjävalinta ilman tunnistautumista. Verkkoyhteistyö tarvitsee myöhemmin todennetun identiteetin ja käyttöoikeudet.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.|Names and IDs are stored in the WITT document for authorship, comments, ratings and votes. This is a local selection, not authentication. Online collaboration will require verified identities and permissions.
