assessmentWeightHint|Valinta tallentuu tähän tiedostoon. Rakenteellinen tila käyttää puun suhdearvoja. Muut tilat käyttävät vain annettuja uskottavuus- ja ajantasaisia vaikutusarvioita. Puuttuva arvio ei ole nolla. Päätösäänestys pysyy erillisenä.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.|Saved per file. Structural uses authored links; human modes use entered credence and current relationship reviews. Missing is not zero. Ballots remain separate.
resultNotDerived|Lehtisolmulla ei ole erillistä johdettua perustelutulosta. Sen uskottavuus vaikuttaa kuitenkin ylempien solmujen laskentaan. Puuttuvilla arvioilla tulos voi jäädä laskematta.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.|A leaf has no separately derived argument result. Its credence still propagates upward. Missing assessments can prevent a result.
