voteArgumentResultHint|Arviointivaiheen perustelutulos, ei muiden osallistujien äänestystulos. † = puutteellisesti arvioitu.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.|Argument result from assessment phase, not other participants’ ballots. † = incomplete assessment.
scoreCappedHigh|Tulos saavutti +100 ylärajan. Muut vaikutukset näkyvät erittelyssä.|Ergebnis hat die Obergrenze +100 erreicht. Weitere Beiträge stehen in der Übersicht.|Balance reached +100 ceiling. Further impacts remain visible in the breakdown.|El balance llegó al límite +100. Otros impactos se ven en el detalle.|Le bilan atteint le plafond +100. Les autres effets figurent en détail.|Баланс достиг +100. Другие вклады видны в деталях.|论证净结果达到 +100 上限，其他影响仍在明细中。|収支が上限 +100 に達しました。他の影響は内訳に残ります。|순결과가 상한 +100에 도달했습니다. 추가 영향은 세부에서 확인할 수 있습니다.
scoreCappedLow|Tulos saavutti −100 alarajan. Muut vaikutukset näkyvät erittelyssä.|Ergebnis hat die Untergrenze −100 erreicht. Weitere Beiträge stehen in der Übersicht.|Balance reached −100 floor. Further impacts remain visible in the breakdown.|El balance llegó al límite −100. Otros impactos se ven en el detalle.|Le bilan atteint le plancher −100. Les autres effets figurent en détail.|Баланс достиг −100. Другие вклады видны в деталях.|论证净结果达到 −100 下限，其他影响仍在明细中。|収支が下限 −100 に達しました。他の影響は内訳に残ります。|순결과가 하한 −100에 도달했습니다. 추가 영향은 세부에서 확인할 수 있습니다.
